    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>1. The Mid-term exam is closed-book. Cheating, plagiarism, or any form of academic dishonesty will result in disciplinary action.&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>2. All quizzes and Lab exercises&nbsp;must be submitted according to the schedule. No late submission will be accepted unless prior approval is granted for valid reasons.</div>\n\n<div>3. The research project may be done individually or in groups of up to three members. Each member of a group is expected to contribute equally.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
